Architecture decision (docs/design/role-and-mode.md): keep dual role at
the data layer, add soft mode switcher at UI. Client/Freelancer/Both —
filters sidebar nav, allows lazy escalation. Best UX without data lock-in.

- ModeSwitcher component in sidebar header (Radix dropdown, optimistic
  cache flip on switch, persists to users.role)
- user.setRole tRPC mutation
- Sidebar filters NAV_GROUPS by mode (client/freelancer hide irrelevant
  rows; 'both' keeps everything)

